<title>USA: First Union Real Estate names new CFO.</title>
<headline>First Union Real Estate names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Real Estate Investments said it named Steven Edelman as its chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He replaces Jim Mastandrea, who had served as interim chief financial officer for the past year.</p>
<p>Edelman joined First Union in 1980. He was formerly the company's executive vice president and chief investment officer.</p>
